title: "Adversarial Anomaly Detection Under Correlated Backgrounds"
abstract: "Synthetic, reproducible study of ON/OFF anomaly detection when an adaptive actor can shrink its footprint, contaminate controls, exploit correlated background noise, and respond to the observer's test design."
